A||||7||batboy||Have a good Memorial Day||||1||
Z||000000||batboy||05-28-2000||08:45 AM||||Hope everyone is having a pleasant Memorial Day weekend. For our international friends, this is a US traditional kick off the opening of summer thing. People fire up the grills for BBQ's, go boating, picnicing, camping, and some still actually remember the true meaning of the holiday by visiting their loved ones gravesites to leave flowers or to just remember them. However you celebrate, hope it's a good one! I'm getting out of here late, but going camping and hiking and beer drinking with some good friends. Should be fun. Chat with you again on Monday evening!||||reg||1
Z||000001||fierospeeder||05-28-2000||09:01 AM||||thanks batboy, have a happy holiday to the rest of you. <P>I work at noon till 8pm at the grocery store, so if you want to beat the crowd, go now when its really early, or when its late.<BR>and dont forget the a-1 sauce or bbq lighter fluid.<P>||||reg||1
Z||000002||Monkeyman||05-28-2000||09:59 AM||||Actually the true meaning of Memorial Day is to remember the fallen in the various wars/conflicts that the US has been in.  <P>Happy Memorial Day to all.  God Bless those that have died for our freedom.<P>(BTW--This will be an especially good holiday weekend as I actually get a day [OK. Night.  Whatever.] off!!!!!  Wah Hoo!!!)||||reg||1
Z||000003||BENGAL4||05-28-2000||02:08 PM||||Go find a parade tomorrow and find a veteran and thank them. Especially our WWII veterans. They are getting up in age and their numbers are less and less each year. Just watch the movie Saving Private Ryan. The sacrifice, that generation made for our freedom, can never be repaid. I make sure my children know  they, and all the other war veterans, are  why we have so much.<p>[This message has been edited by BENGAL4 (edited 05-28-2000).]||||reg||14
Z||000004||Coconut||05-28-2000||02:59 PM||||My parents were of pre-adolescent age when the Japanese occupied Guam in WWII and they have passed on to my generation the stories of how Brave,Gallant and Honorable the men of the U.S. Armed Forces were in Liberating Guam. I don't want to go into detail what they saw first hand, but there has always been a measure of Love,Honor and Respect for all those who fought and paid the price for our Freedom, in this Family. God Bless our Vets, your sacrifices will never be forgotten.<P>Have a Fun,Safe Holiday Everyone !||||reg||14
Z||000005||Ozzy||05-28-2000||04:06 PM||||Cheers Batboy and evryone else...<P><BR>Be carefull on the roads and DON't drink and drive...(Not tryin' to tell anyone what to do...just want to see everyone back here again! <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif"> )<P>Batboy...Carefull not to step in any bat <I>guano</I>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P>Ozzy||||reg||1
Z||000006||batboy||05-29-2000||06:52 PM||||I made it home safe and sound. Had a good time. Hope y'all had a great weekend too.||||reg||1
